Version: 1.0
desc: Word for Word Convolution Reverb (x42 Convolver port) by chmaha
tags: reverb convolution impulse response hall room plate ambience vintage digital
author: chmaha
changelog:
  Initial release.
about:
  Convolution reverb with 53 hall, room, plate, space, ambience and effect programs captured from a classic
  digital studio reverb, in stereo or fed from a mono sum. The convolution engine splits the impulse response into
  partitions that grow with distance from the start, so long halls stay light on the CPU; Zero Latency switches to a direct-form head for no delay at all.
  Ported from the x42 Convolver (zeroconvo.lv2) by Robin Gareus
  https://github.com/x42/zconvo.lv2 (GPL-3.0-or-later, convolution engine by Fons Adriaensen)
  Impulse responses: Grant Nelson's personal Lexicon 480L impulse responses (Housecall FM),
  https://www.housecallfm.com/download-gns-personal-lexicon-480l
  (see Dependencies/WordForWord/WordForWord-LICENSE.txt), with the level matching from the x42 presets
  JSFX version released under GPL-3.0-or-later
  Claude generated some of this code
